[{"code":"record_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":82,"col":37},"end":{"line":82,"col":40}},"title":"RECORD MAY BE SHARED","message":"`Box` may keep a record it is handed, which is then changed in place, and the\nchecker cannot show that nothing else still holds the record.\n\n82|                    score (viaParam Box { x = 0 })\n                                       ^^^ the record is changed in place here\n\nCopy the record with `Record.copy` before it is changed, so the change cannot\nreach anything else that holds it.\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: Main.viaParam changes what\nit hands this function (π2) after the call, itself or through another function,\nand the function's result may keep it."},{"code":"record_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":83,"col":34},"end":{"line":83,"col":42}},"title":"RECORD MAY BE SHARED","message":"`<call Main.viaField>` may keep a record it is handed, which is then changed in\nplace, and the checker cannot show that nothing else still holds the record.\n\n83|                        + score (viaField { mk = Box } { x = 0 })\n                                    ^^^^^^^^ the record is changed in place here\n\nCopy the record with `Record.copy` before it is changed, so the change cannot\nreach anything else that holds it.\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: Main.viaField changes what\nit hands this function (π2) after the call, itself or through another function,\nand the function's result may keep it."},{"code":"record_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":84,"col":34},"end":{"line":84,"col":42}},"title":"RECORD MAY BE SHARED","message":"`<call Main.viaTuple>` may keep a record it is handed, which is then changed in\nplace, and the checker cannot show that nothing else still holds the record.\n\n84|                        + score (viaTuple ( Box, 0 ) { x = 0 })\n    